stage: 7
finding: CONTRIBUTING.md does not tell a contributor how to run the Node tier that now owns the moved GPU claims. Its Commands section lists test, GPU, browser and oracle commands but no Node command; Verification only says Node tests remain named *.node.ts and run on macOS. bun run test therefore silently omits those claims with no documented replacement invocation. CI's actual replacement is bun test $(find ./src ./examples ./scripts ./diagnostics -name '*.node.ts' -print). The tier split is consistent with the settled ceilings, but the public contributor seam is incomplete: a stranger cannot follow CONTRIBUTING to execute the coverage that was removed from their default local run.
